<title>Thomas’s No-Reserve Holiday Auction — Ends December 05, 2025</title>
<description>I’m running an auction to clear out some games that I’ve had difficulty selling or trading.
There will be NO RESERVE — every game must go, even if it sells for $1 or is given away for free.

🚚 Shipping

Buyer pays actual shipping from Merced, CA (95341).

Packaging materials are included in the shipping cost.

I’ll provide package weights and box dimensions for each title with at least one bid so that bidders can estimate shipping beforehand using PirateShip. I will do my best to do this in a timely manner.

I will not purchase boxes for unsold games — any games that do not sell will be donated.

Combined shipping is available, and I’ll do my best to quote accurate totals.

Optional: I can hold and ship after January 5th to avoid higher holiday shipping rates.

⏰ Auction Schedule

Start: November 24, 2025

End: December 5, 2025 @ 7:00 PM PST

Winners will receive payment and shipping details within 48 hours of the auction closing.

Payment is due within 48 hours of receiving the invoice.

💳 Payment

PayPal Goods &amp; Services preferred (+3% fee)

Friends &amp; Family accepted if you’re comfortable with it.

Communication may be a bit delayed since I’m heading into finals week, but I’ll stay in touch and ensure prompt fulfillment.

🧭 How to Bid

Reply under the post for the specific game you want.

Post new bids as separate comments — [b]Edited bids are invalid. [/b]

Each bid must be at least $1 higher than the previous bid.

BGG timestamps determine the winning bid at auction close.

🕐 Anti-Sniping Policy

To keep things fair and prevent last-second sniping:

Any item that receives a bid within the last hour before the auction ends will stay open for an additional hour past the scheduled close time.

I won’t be monitoring minute-by-minute, but BGG timestamps will determine validity.

Example:
If the auction ends at 7:00 PM and someone bids at 6:45 PM, that item’s new close time becomes 8:00 PM.
If another bid comes in at 7:45 PM, it extends again to 8:45 PM, and so on — one hour after the most recent valid bid.
[size=18][b]⚖️ Can you hold games or combine multiple wins?[/b][/size]
Yes — happy to combine items and delay shipment if requested.

[size=18][b]🔍 What condition are the games in?[/b][/size]
All are complete and from a smoke-free unless otherwise noted. We do have dog, who is in the house occasionally, but he spends most of his time playing outside.
Any wear, missing components, or non-English editions will be mentioned individually.

[size=18][b]⏰ When does the auction end?[/b][/size]
Ends December 5, 2025 @ 7:00 PM PST.
Highest valid bid at that time wins. Winners will be contacted within 24 hours.

[size=18][b]📬 When will items ship?[/b][/size]
I’ll ship within 2–4 days of payment unless you request post-holiday shipping.
Tracking will be provided.

[b]🧾 Anything else I should know?[/b]
I’m a student majoring in electrical engineering and my workload with school is high — communication might be slightly delayed, but I’ll stay in touch and ensure everything is shipped promptly.
Thanks for your understanding, and happy bidding!</description>

	

